# Frontend

- Web is Next.js in `apps/web`. Android is Expo in `apps/mobile`.
- Share types and the API client via `@keepwise/shared`. Do not share screens.
- Do not reimplement warranty/reminder math on the client except display helpers.
- Keep UI simple, accessible, and responsive. Use existing `components/ui.tsx` primitives.
- Do not add another component library.
- Handle loading, empty, and error states on every data view.
